ous regions of the kingdom where the King will require your services.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Noticing points of interest might lead you to rewards or unexpected encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Search and loot everything that could be useful for your army.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999050/extras/bbf4ce8d0c238de90bb134cf3d3c8b21.poster.avif?t=1756722639\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999050/extras/bbf4ce8d0c238de90bb134cf3d3c8b21.webm?t=1756722639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999050/extras/bbf4ce8d0c238de90bb134cf3d3c8b21.mp4?t=1756722639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lead your army on the battlefied</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight in epic battles with various objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each victory will increase the King's satisfaction.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lead your army to glory by gaining experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-crafted medieval campaign</strong> with regional maps and unique mission modifiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep soldier management:</strong> train, equip and specialize every unit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permadeath &amp; injuries:</strong> losses shape your strategy and the camp\u2019s mood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable camp:</strong> buildings and upgrades for 